      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know where the help numbers are, i've seen them a million times. it just feels like they're just another automated response in the system, you know? like a canned script to keep the machine running. it doesn't change the fact that everything feels so fundamentally empty. it's like the more we connect through these screens, the more we realize there's nothing actually there. just static.",
